<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: These quirks determine how much a pawn likes digesting prey or converting them into other materials. At the extremes, the pawn will either never or always try to digest prey.-->
  <GoalPreference_Predator_Digest.description>这些怪癖决定了多少钱一个pawn喜欢消化猎物或将其转化为其他材料。在极端情况下,pawn将永远不会或总是尝试消化猎物。</GoalPreference_Predator_Digest.description>
  <!--EN: Predatory goal preference (digestion)-->
  <GoalPreference_Predator_Digest.label>掠夺性目标偏好 (消化)</GoalPreference_Predator_Digest.label>
  <!--EN: [PAWN_label] dislikes digesting prey. [PAWN_pronoun] takes no enjoyment out of gurgling a life away and would rather [PAWN_possessive] prey left intact.-->
  <GoalPreference_Predator_Digest_Dislikes.description>[PAWN_label]不喜欢消化猎物。[PAWN_pronoun]不要从咯咯笑的生活中获取乐趣，宁愿[PAWN_possessive]猎物完好无损。</GoalPreference_Predator_Digest_Dislikes.description>
  <!--EN: Digestion aversion-->
  <GoalPreference_Predator_Digest_Dislikes.label>厌恶消化</GoalPreference_Predator_Digest_Dislikes.label>
  <!--EN: As a fondeu(r/se), [PAWN_label] likes the feeling of prey digesting into mush, or milk, or spunk, or what-have-you: to feel the struggle cease, and the hard lumps go soft.-->
  <GoalPreference_Predator_Digest_Likes.description>作为一个fondeu(r/se),[PAWN_label]喜欢猎物被消化成糊状物、乳汁、尖刺或什么东西的感觉: 感觉斗争停止，硬块变软了。</GoalPreference_Predator_Digest_Likes.description>
  <!--EN: Fondeur-->
  <GoalPreference_Predator_Digest_Likes.label>底池</GoalPreference_Predator_Digest_Likes.label>
  <!--EN: [PAWN_label] doesn't really care one way or the other about digesting prey.-->
  <GoalPreference_Predator_Digest_Neutral.description>[PAWN_label]不在乎如何消化猎物。</GoalPreference_Predator_Digest_Neutral.description>
  <!--EN: Digestion ambivalence-->
  <GoalPreference_Predator_Digest_Neutral.label>消化矛盾</GoalPreference_Predator_Digest_Neutral.label>
  <!--EN: As an obsessive fondeu(r/se), [PAWN_label] loves digestion and all manner of conversion into bodily fluids, to the neglect of other goals.-->
  <GoalPreference_Predator_Digest_Obsessed.description>作为一个过度狂fondeu(r/se),[PAWN_label]热爱消化和各种体液转换方式，忽视其他目标。</GoalPreference_Predator_Digest_Obsessed.description>
  <!--EN: Obsessive fondeur-->
  <GoalPreference_Predator_Digest_Obsessed.label>迷恋型民俗</GoalPreference_Predator_Digest_Obsessed.label>
  <!--EN: [PAWN_label] hates digesting prey. What an act of unimaginable cruelty!-->
  <GoalPreference_Predator_Digest_Refuses.description>[PAWN_label]讨厌消化猎物。多么残忍的行为!</GoalPreference_Predator_Digest_Refuses.description>
  <!--EN: Digestion disgust-->
  <GoalPreference_Predator_Digest_Refuses.label>厌恶消化</GoalPreference_Predator_Digest_Refuses.label>
  <!--EN: These quirks determine how much a pawn likes healing prey.-->
  <GoalPreference_Predator_Heal.description>这些怪癖决定了多少钱一个pawn喜欢治愈猎物。</GoalPreference_Predator_Heal.description>
  <!--EN: Predatory goal preference (heal)-->
  <GoalPreference_Predator_Heal.label>掠夺性目标偏好 (愈合)</GoalPreference_Predator_Heal.label>
  <!--EN: [PAWN_label] dislikes healing prey.-->
  <GoalPreference_Predator_Heal_Dislikes.description>[PAWN_label]厌恶治疗猎物。</GoalPreference_Predator_Heal_Dislikes.description>
  <!--EN: Unhealthy pred-->
  <GoalPreference_Predator_Heal_Dislikes.label>不健康的 pred</GoalPreference_Predator_Heal_Dislikes.label>
  <!--EN: As a professional MMO Healer, [PAWN_label] likes to carry their team.-->
  <GoalPreference_Predator_Heal_Likes.description>作为一名专业的 MMO 医师,[PAWN_label]喜欢带领团队前进。</GoalPreference_Predator_Heal_Likes.description>
  <!--EN: Healer-->
  <GoalPreference_Predator_Heal_Likes.label>治疗师</GoalPreference_Predator_Heal_Likes.label>
  <!--EN: [PAWN_label] doesn't really care one way or the other about healing prey.-->
  <GoalPreference_Predator_Heal_Neutral.description>[PAWN_label]不在乎如何治愈猎物。</GoalPreference_Predator_Heal_Neutral.description>
  <!--EN: Heal ambivalence-->
  <GoalPreference_Predator_Heal_Neutral.label>自愈</GoalPreference_Predator_Heal_Neutral.label>
  <!--EN: No need to spam E, [PAWN_label] has got you covered with a cozy place to stay in and get healthy.-->
  <GoalPreference_Predator_Heal_Obsessed.description>不需要发垃圾邮件给 E,[PAWN_label]为你提供了一个舒适的住宿和健康之所。</GoalPreference_Predator_Heal_Obsessed.description>
  <!--EN: Heal Slut-->
  <GoalPreference_Predator_Heal_Obsessed.label>治愈暴徒</GoalPreference_Predator_Heal_Obsessed.label>
  <!--EN: [PAWN_label] hates healing prey.-->
  <GoalPreference_Predator_Heal_Refuses.description>[PAWN_label]憎恨治愈猎物。</GoalPreference_Predator_Heal_Refuses.description>
  <!--EN: Healing refusal-->
  <GoalPreference_Predator_Heal_Refuses.label>拒绝治疗</GoalPreference_Predator_Heal_Refuses.label>
  <!--EN: These quirks determine how much a pawn likes temporarily storing live prey.-->
  <GoalPreference_Predator_Hold.description>这些怪癖决定了多少钱一个pawn喜欢临时储存活着的猎物。</GoalPreference_Predator_Hold.description>
  <!--EN: Predatory goal preference (Hold)-->
  <GoalPreference_Predator_Hold.label>掠夺性目标偏好 (持有)</GoalPreference_Predator_Hold.label>
  <!--EN: [PAWN_label] dislikes temporarily storing prey.-->
  <GoalPreference_Predator_Hold_Dislikes.description>[PAWN_label]厌恶临时收容的猎物。</GoalPreference_Predator_Hold_Dislikes.description>
  <!--EN: UnHoldy pred-->
  <GoalPreference_Predator_Hold_Dislikes.label>未收容的 pred</GoalPreference_Predator_Hold_Dislikes.label>
  <!--EN: As a Holder, [PAWN_label] likes to pass their prey.-->
  <GoalPreference_Predator_Hold_Likes.description>作为持有者,[PAWN_label]喜欢传递它们的猎物。</GoalPreference_Predator_Hold_Likes.description>
  <!--EN: Holder-->
  <GoalPreference_Predator_Hold_Likes.label>持有者</GoalPreference_Predator_Hold_Likes.label>
  <!--EN: [PAWN_label] doesn't really care one way or the other about temporarily storing prey.-->
  <GoalPreference_Predator_Hold_Neutral.description>[PAWN_label]不在乎以何种方式暂时储存猎物。</GoalPreference_Predator_Hold_Neutral.description>
  <!--EN: Hold ambivalence-->
  <GoalPreference_Predator_Hold_Neutral.label>抱着矛盾心态</GoalPreference_Predator_Hold_Neutral.label>
  <!--EN: As a heavy Holder, [PAWN_label] loves to allow [PAWN_possessive] prey a trip through [PAWN_objective]self.-->
  <GoalPreference_Predator_Hold_Obsessed.description>作为一名重武器,[PAWN_label]喜好[PAWN_possessive]猎物通过[PAWN_objective]自己。</GoalPreference_Predator_Hold_Obsessed.description>
  <!--EN: Heavy Holder-->
  <GoalPreference_Predator_Hold_Obsessed.label>重型支架</GoalPreference_Predator_Hold_Obsessed.label>
  <!--EN: [PAWN_label] hates storing prey temporarily.-->
  <GoalPreference_Predator_Hold_Refuses.description>[PAWN_label]讨厌临时储存猎物。</GoalPreference_Predator_Hold_Refuses.description>
  <!--EN: Holding refusal-->
  <GoalPreference_Predator_Hold_Refuses.label>抱着拒绝</GoalPreference_Predator_Hold_Refuses.label>
  <!--EN: These quirks determine how much a pawn likes consuming prey for mutual pleasure. At the extremes, the pawn will either never or always try to pleasure prey.-->
  <GoalPreference_Predator_Pleasure.description>这些怪癖决定了多少钱一个pawn喜欢吸食对方的猎物。在极端情况下,pawn将永远不会或总是尝试捕食。</GoalPreference_Predator_Pleasure.description>
  <!--EN: Predatory goal preference (pleasure)-->
  <GoalPreference_Predator_Pleasure.label>掠夺性目标偏好 (快感)</GoalPreference_Predator_Pleasure.label>
  <!--EN: [PAWN_label] dislikes pleasuring prey. Maybe [PAWN_pronoun]'s squeamish about letting prey get lewd inside [PAWN_objective]; maybe [PAWN_pronoun] just doesn't enjoy it like prey do.-->
  <GoalPreference_Predator_Pleasure_Dislikes.description>[PAWN_label]不喜欢快乐的猎物。也许[PAWN_pronoun]因为让猎物得到淫秽的内[PAWN_objective]; 可能[PAWN_pronoun]只是不像猎物那样享受它。</GoalPreference_Predator_Pleasure_Dislikes.description>
  <!--EN: Chaste predator-->
  <GoalPreference_Predator_Pleasure_Dislikes.label>贞洁的肉食动物</GoalPreference_Predator_Pleasure_Dislikes.label>
  <!--EN: [PAWN_label] likes to pleasure-vore prey, with a sensual tour of [PAWN_possessive] body.-->
  <GoalPreference_Predator_Pleasure_Likes.description>[PAWN_label]喜欢愉悦-吃人猎物性感的游览[PAWN_possessive]身体。</GoalPreference_Predator_Pleasure_Likes.description>
  <!--EN: Plaire-->
  <GoalPreference_Predator_Pleasure_Likes.label>圣境</GoalPreference_Predator_Pleasure_Likes.label>
  <!--EN: [PAWN_label] doesn't really care one way or the other about pleasuring prey.-->
  <GoalPreference_Predator_Pleasure_Neutral.description>[PAWN_label]不在乎如何取悦猎物。</GoalPreference_Predator_Pleasure_Neutral.description>
  <!--EN: Pleasure ambivalence-->
  <GoalPreference_Predator_Pleasure_Neutral.label>愉悦与矛盾</GoalPreference_Predator_Pleasure_Neutral.label>
  <!--EN: [PAWN_label] loves to pleasure-vore prey. [PAWN_pronoun] seeks little else besides the usage of [PAWN_possessive] body as an engine of pleasure.-->
  <GoalPreference_Predator_Pleasure_Obsessed.description>[PAWN_label]喜欢愉悦-吃人猎物。[PAWN_pronoun]除了使用[PAWN_possessive]作为愉悦引擎的身体。</GoalPreference_Predator_Pleasure_Obsessed.description>
  <!--EN: Obsessive plaire-->
  <GoalPreference_Predator_Pleasure_Obsessed.label>痴迷广场</GoalPreference_Predator_Pleasure_Obsessed.label>
  <!--EN: [PAWN_label] hates pleasuring prey. Vore is not to be treated as a fancy sex position.-->
  <GoalPreference_Predator_Pleasure_Refuses.description>[PAWN_label]讨厌愉悦的猎物。吃人不被认为是幻想性交位置。</GoalPreference_Predator_Pleasure_Refuses.description>
  <!--EN: Celibate predator-->
  <GoalPreference_Predator_Pleasure_Refuses.label>独身捕食者</GoalPreference_Predator_Pleasure_Refuses.label>
  <!--EN: These quirks determine how much a pawn likes indefinitely storing live prey. At the extremes, the pawn will either never or always try to store prey.-->
  <GoalPreference_Predator_Store.description>这些怪癖决定了多少钱一个pawn喜欢无限期储存活猎物。在极端情况下,pawn将永远不会或总是尝试储存猎物。</GoalPreference_Predator_Store.description>
  <!--EN: Predatory goal preference (storage)-->
  <GoalPreference_Predator_Store.label>掠夺性目标偏好 (存储)</GoalPreference_Predator_Store.label>
  <!--EN: [PAWN_label] dislikes storing prey indefinitely. [PAWN_pronoun] doesn't want to be burdened by prey longer than [PAWN_pronoun] has to. Find someone else to be your warehouse.-->
  <GoalPreference_Predator_Store_Dislikes.description>[PAWN_label]不喜欢无限期储存猎物。[PAWN_pronoun]不想被猎物压得比[PAWN_pronoun]必须这么做。找其他人做你的仓库。</GoalPreference_Predator_Store_Dislikes.description>
  <!--EN: Noncommittal pred-->
  <GoalPreference_Predator_Store_Dislikes.label>不务正业</GoalPreference_Predator_Store_Dislikes.label>
  <!--EN: As a geolier(e), [PAWN_label] likes to hold onto prey for as long as possible. [PAWN_pronoun] would make a good jail cell.-->
  <GoalPreference_Predator_Store_Likes.description>作为一个geolier(e),[PAWN_label]喜欢尽可能长时间地抓住猎物。[PAWN_pronoun]会成为一间不错的牢房。</GoalPreference_Predator_Store_Likes.description>
  <!--EN: Geolier-->
  <GoalPreference_Predator_Store_Likes.label>大地巨石</GoalPreference_Predator_Store_Likes.label>
  <!--EN: [PAWN_label] doesn't really care one way or the other about storing prey.-->
  <GoalPreference_Predator_Store_Neutral.description>[PAWN_label]不在乎猎物的储存方式。</GoalPreference_Predator_Store_Neutral.description>
  <!--EN: Storage ambivalence-->
  <GoalPreference_Predator_Store_Neutral.label>储存矛盾心理</GoalPreference_Predator_Store_Neutral.label>
  <!--EN: As a geolier(e), [PAWN_label] loves to hold onto prey for as long as possible, and would be delighted to store as many people as can be fit inside of [PAWN_objective] forever.-->
  <GoalPreference_Predator_Store_Obsessed.description>作为一个geolier(e),[PAWN_label]喜欢尽可能长时间地抓住猎物，并且很乐意将尽可能多的人储存在[PAWN_objective]永远</GoalPreference_Predator_Store_Obsessed.description>
  <!--EN: Geolier hoarder-->
  <GoalPreference_Predator_Store_Obsessed.label>大地聚居者</GoalPreference_Predator_Store_Obsessed.label>
  <!--EN: [PAWN_label] hates storing prey indefinitely. Find someone else to be your warehouse.-->
  <GoalPreference_Predator_Store_Refuses.description>[PAWN_label]讨厌无限期储存猎物。找其他人做你的仓库。</GoalPreference_Predator_Store_Refuses.description>
  <!--EN: In-and-out pred-->
  <GoalPreference_Predator_Store_Refuses.label>进出 pred</GoalPreference_Predator_Store_Refuses.label>
  <!--EN: These quirks determine how much a pawn wants to be digested (or converted into some other material). At the extremes, the pawn will either never or always try to be digested. Be careful increasing the commonality of a digestion preference: willing pawns can easily be killed by predators with little notice.-->
  <GoalPreference_Prey_Digest.description>这些怪癖决定了多少钱一个pawn希望被消化 (或转化为其他材料)。在极端情况下,pawn将永远不会或总是尝试被消化。提高消化偏好的共性要小心: 意志坚定的殖民者很容易被捕食者杀死，而很少有人注意到。</GoalPreference_Prey_Digest.description>
  <!--EN: Preyish goal preference (digestion)-->
  <GoalPreference_Prey_Digest.label>猎物目标偏好 (消化)</GoalPreference_Prey_Digest.label>
  <!--EN: [PAWN_label] is not particularly interested in an early, acidic grave.-->
  <GoalPreference_Prey_Digest_Dislikes.description>[PAWN_label]对早期的酸性坟墓不是特别感兴趣。</GoalPreference_Prey_Digest_Dislikes.description>
  <!--EN: Alimentary aversion-->
  <GoalPreference_Prey_Digest_Dislikes.label>厌恶食物</GoalPreference_Prey_Digest_Dislikes.label>
  <!--EN: As an aliment(e), [PAWN_label] often thinks about getting digested someday.-->
  <GoalPreference_Prey_Digest_Likes.description>作为一个aliment(e),[PAWN_label]经常想着有一天能被消化掉。</GoalPreference_Prey_Digest_Likes.description>
  <!--EN: Aliment-->
  <GoalPreference_Prey_Digest_Likes.label>复活</GoalPreference_Prey_Digest_Likes.label>
  <!--EN: [PAWN_label] doesn't really care one way or the other about being digested.-->
  <GoalPreference_Prey_Digest_Neutral.description>[PAWN_label]不在乎是否被消化。</GoalPreference_Prey_Digest_Neutral.description>
  <!--EN: Alimentary ambivalence-->
  <GoalPreference_Prey_Digest_Neutral.label>营养矛盾</GoalPreference_Prey_Digest_Neutral.label>
  <!--EN: As an obsessive aliment(e), [PAWN_label] just can't help it; [PAWN_pronoun] wants to be utterly digested.-->
  <GoalPreference_Prey_Digest_Obsessed.description>作为一个过度狂aliment(e),[PAWN_label]无法控制;[PAWN_pronoun]想要被完全消化。</GoalPreference_Prey_Digest_Obsessed.description>
  <!--EN: Digestion-wish-->
  <GoalPreference_Prey_Digest_Obsessed.label>消化-希望</GoalPreference_Prey_Digest_Obsessed.label>
  <!--EN: Are you mad? Who would want to be digested alive? [PAWN_label] certainly doesn't.-->
  <GoalPreference_Prey_Digest_Refuses.description>你疯了吗？谁想被活着消化？[PAWN_label]当然不是。</GoalPreference_Prey_Digest_Refuses.description>
  <!--EN: Life-wish-->
  <GoalPreference_Prey_Digest_Refuses.label>希望活下去的孩子</GoalPreference_Prey_Digest_Refuses.label>
  <!--EN: These quirks determine how much a pawn wants to be healed inside a predator. At the extremes, the pawn will either never or always try to be heal-vored.-->
  <GoalPreference_Prey_Heal.description>这些怪癖决定了多少钱一个pawn想要在捕食者体内治愈。在极端情况下,pawn将永远不会或总是尝试被治愈。</GoalPreference_Prey_Heal.description>
  <!--EN: Preyish goal preference (heal)-->
  <GoalPreference_Prey_Heal.label>猎物目标偏好 (愈合)</GoalPreference_Prey_Heal.label>
  <!--EN: [PAWN_label] would prefer not being vored this way, even if it would be beneficial for their health.-->
  <GoalPreference_Prey_Heal_Dislikes.description>[PAWN_label]宁愿不被这样照料，即使这对他们的健康是有益的。</GoalPreference_Prey_Heal_Dislikes.description>
  <!--EN: Uncomfortable prey-->
  <GoalPreference_Prey_Heal_Dislikes.label>不舒服的猎物</GoalPreference_Prey_Heal_Dislikes.label>
  <!--EN: [PAWN_label] prefers healing vore over an expensive trip to a spa.-->
  <GoalPreference_Prey_Heal_Likes.description>[PAWN_label]更喜欢治疗吃人一次昂贵的温泉旅行。</GoalPreference_Prey_Heal_Likes.description>
  <!--EN: Cozy prey-->
  <GoalPreference_Prey_Heal_Likes.label>舒适的猎物</GoalPreference_Prey_Heal_Likes.label>
  <!--EN: [PAWN_label] doesn't really care one way or the other about being vored for health.-->
  <GoalPreference_Prey_Heal_Neutral.description>[PAWN_label]不在乎为了健康而被抛弃。</GoalPreference_Prey_Heal_Neutral.description>
  <!--EN: Heal ambivalence-->
  <GoalPreference_Prey_Heal_Neutral.label>自愈</GoalPreference_Prey_Heal_Neutral.label>
  <!--EN: [PAWN_label] always feels like they need to slip into someone to be healed, even when [PAWN_possessive] is perfectly fine.-->
  <GoalPreference_Prey_Heal_Obsessed.description>[PAWN_label]总觉得自己需要偷偷溜入某人体内才能被治愈，即使是在[PAWN_possessive]非常好。</GoalPreference_Prey_Heal_Obsessed.description>
  <!--EN: Hypochondriac-->
  <GoalPreference_Prey_Heal_Obsessed.label>忧郁症患者</GoalPreference_Prey_Heal_Obsessed.label>
  <!--EN: [PAWN_label] would rather succumb to their injuries than allow [PAWN_objective]self to be used as a healing prey.-->
  <GoalPreference_Prey_Heal_Refuses.description>[PAWN_label]宁愿负伤也不愿屈服[PAWN_objective]自己将被用作治愈猎物。</GoalPreference_Prey_Heal_Refuses.description>
  <!--EN: Trypanophobia-->
  <GoalPreference_Prey_Heal_Refuses.label>锥虫恐惧症</GoalPreference_Prey_Heal_Refuses.label>
  <!--EN: These quirks determine how much a pawn wants to be temporarily stored inside a predator. At the extremes, the pawn will either never or always try to be temp-stored.-->
  <GoalPreference_Prey_Hold.description>这些怪癖决定了多少钱一个pawn希望被暂时储存在一个捕食者体内。在极端情况下,pawn将永远不会或总是尝试温度存储。</GoalPreference_Prey_Hold.description>
  <!--EN: Preyish goal preference (Hold)-->
  <GoalPreference_Prey_Hold.label>猎物目标偏好 (保持)</GoalPreference_Prey_Hold.label>
  <!--EN: If you have to eat [PAWN_label], at least don't make it an extended stay. [PAWN_pronoun] has [PAWN_possessive] own things to do.-->
  <GoalPreference_Prey_Hold_Dislikes.description>如果必须进食[PAWN_label],至少不要延长停留时间。[PAWN_pronoun]有[PAWN_possessive]有自己的事情要做。</GoalPreference_Prey_Hold_Dislikes.description>
  <!--EN: Busy prey-->
  <GoalPreference_Prey_Hold_Dislikes.label>忙碌的猎物</GoalPreference_Prey_Hold_Dislikes.label>
  <!--EN: Sometimes, [PAWN_label] just wants to take a vacation inside of someone. Or move in.-->
  <GoalPreference_Prey_Hold_Likes.description>有时,[PAWN_label]只想在某人体内度假。或者搬进去。</GoalPreference_Prey_Hold_Likes.description>
  <!--EN: Live-in prey-->
  <GoalPreference_Prey_Hold_Likes.label>食人猎物</GoalPreference_Prey_Hold_Likes.label>
  <!--EN: [PAWN_label] doesn't really care one way or the other about being held temporarily.-->
  <GoalPreference_Prey_Hold_Neutral.description>[PAWN_label]不在乎被暂时关押。</GoalPreference_Prey_Hold_Neutral.description>
  <!--EN: Hold ambivalence-->
  <GoalPreference_Prey_Hold_Neutral.label>抱着矛盾心态</GoalPreference_Prey_Hold_Neutral.label>
  <!--EN: [PAWN_label] loves passing through and taking in the sights of [PAWN_possessive] predators.-->
  <GoalPreference_Prey_Hold_Obsessed.description>[PAWN_label]喜欢穿过并欣赏[PAWN_possessive]捕食者。</GoalPreference_Prey_Hold_Obsessed.description>
  <!--EN: In-and-out prey-->
  <GoalPreference_Prey_Hold_Obsessed.label>进出的猎物</GoalPreference_Prey_Hold_Obsessed.label>
  <!--EN: [PAWN_label] cannot think of a life more boring than squishing around inside of a predator for days, months, or heaven forbid, years.-->
  <GoalPreference_Prey_Hold_Refuses.description>[PAWN_label]我想不出还有比在捕食者体内持续数天、数月或者几年更无趣的生活了。</GoalPreference_Prey_Hold_Refuses.description>
  <!--EN: Unwilling-->
